<title>SWITZERLAND: Alusuisse H1 net profit rises 5 percent.</title>
<headline>Alusuisse H1 net profit rises 5 percent.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30:</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net profit	     207		 vs 197</p>
<p> Group net per share, Sfr   34		  vs 32</p>
<p> Group operating profit     334		 vs 322</p>
<p> Group net sales		3,874	     vs 3,883</p>
<p> Group cash flow		434		 vs 336</p>
<p> Employees (end-June)	 31,490	    vs 25,833</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Alusuisse-Lonza Holding AG. -- Zurich Newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
